      "sha256": "60f8d81d92ef5e1246dc9388424cc87e17c9910daf0427f9202671ab62b49270",
      "note": "DXMT's complete source at the commit its package was built from: git archive of a148782d43 with its two submodules filled (external/nvapi at d08488fcc8, include/native/directx at 9df86f2341), one folder named after the commit, gzip -n (dxmt/make-source.sh gives the same bytes). GitHub's tarball of the commit (795624 bytes, sha256 ed650f5058c44ba1abb30ad7fb8bdc3f6cb9e44170d45136c6909569ddc3265d, on the r7 release as dxmt-a148782d43.tar.gz) leaves both submodules empty."
