      "licence": "LGPL-2.1-or-later",
      "note": "The source of Wine's start-up code (winecrt0) statically linked into DXMT's winemetal.dll. DXMT's CI links it from 3Shain's Wine 8.16 build, the release v8.16-3shain (wine.tar.gz, 230434672 bytes, sha256 289c7f19e270a3d3d0a6fdb07691b176c70a0795f6811e5255cba82425de4f10), whose source is https://github.com/3Shain/wine at 4dd8a2d6dca39a116d0911f247bbaf1ad5e29471. The archive holds dlls/winecrt0, every header it includes (dxmt/winecrt0-files.txt, made by dxmt/winecrt0-closure.py) and Wine's COPYING.LIB, LICENSE, AUTHORS and VERSION; dxmt/make-winecrt0-source.sh gives the same bytes."
    },
